.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

*.env
/tracking-plan.json

# Tenant files carry live credentials (tenant_api_key, internal_token, the
# MoEngage basic-auth secret, the Adjust s2s token), so only the redacted
# examples are tracked.
#
# Both extensions are listed because TenantRegistry accepts either
# (Config/TenantRegistry.cs, deploy/tenants/README.md) — an operator who
# follows the README and names their copy `zainmart.json` must not have it
# staged by `git add -A`.
#
# Anchored to the directory that holds them, with no leading-slash-free glob:
# a bare `*.jsonc` matches every path segment in the tree, so it would also
# swallow future tooling configs (tsconfig.jsonc, biome.jsonc) silently —
# ignored files produce no `git status` entry and no error, and the author
# would only find out from a teammate's broken checkout.
/deploy/tenants/*.json
/deploy/tenants/*.jsonc
!/deploy/tenants/*.example.json
!/deploy/tenants/*.example.jsonc
.cigate/
